; HSMW-CNC v1
PARAM SetupName Setup1
PARAM OperationName Arc contour
PARAM OperationKind 2D Contour
PARAM StartX 110
PARAM StartY 25
PARAM StartZ 15
PARAM ToolKind Flat end mill
PARAM ToolDiameter 6
PARAM SpindleSpeed 3500
PARAM WorkOffset 2
PARAM OriginX 100
PARAM OriginY 25
PARAM OriginZ 5
PARAM ClearancePlane 15
PARAM RetractPlane 12
PARAM TopOfStock 10
PARAM StockXYLeft 80
PARAM StockXYRight 120
PARAM StockXYFront 10
PARAM StockXYBack 40
PARAM StockZTop 10
PARAM StockZBottom 3
PARAM Coolant off
TOOL 2 FLAT-6
SECTION
Rapid X 110000 Y 25000 Z 15000
Plunge X 110000 Y 25000 Z 9000 F 120000
Arc CCW X 100000 Y 35000 Z 9000 F 350000 I 100000 J 25000
Arc CW X 110000 Y 25000 Z 9000 F 350000 I 100000 J 25000
Feed X 115000 Y 25000 Z 9000 F 220000
Rapid X 115000 Y 25000 Z 15000
ENDSECTION
